{"id":"verstorben","lemma":"verstorben","pos":"adj","rank":3916,"glosses":["deceased, late"],"ipa":"/fɛʁˈʃtɔʁbn̩/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/23/De-verstorben.ogg/De-verstorben.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er ist gestern verstorben.","en":"He died yesterday.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"yesterday"},null]},{"text":"Ihre Mutter ist letztes Jahr verstorben.","en":"Her mother passed away last year.","words":[{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"last","l":"letzte"},{"g":"year"},null]},{"text":"Tom ist später im Krankenhaus verstorben.","en":"Tom later died at the hospital.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"later"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"hospital"},null]},{"text":"Er ist ziemlich plötzlich verstorben.","en":"He passed away quite suddenly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"pretty"},{"g":"suddenly, abruptly"},null]},{"text":"Ich hörte, Tom sei verstorben.","en":"I heard that Tom has passed away.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},null]}]}